# UI conventions

- Add primitives with `npx untitledui@latest add <component>` into `src/components/base/**` /
  `src/components/application/**`; keep upstream file names. ERP composites live in `src/components/erp/**`
  (`DocList`, `DocForm`, `ChildTable`, `FieldRenderer`, `LinkField`, `StatusBadge`, `DocActions`, `TreeView`,
  `ReportView`, `DashboardView`, `NumberCard`, `DashboardChart`, `ConnectionsPanel`, `Timeline`).
- Build screens from a `defineDoctype()` descriptor + the generic composites. A bespoke page needs a reason in the module doc.
- Tailwind v4 only: `@import "tailwindcss"; @import "./theme.css"; @plugin "tailwindcss-react-aria-components";
  @plugin "tailwindcss-animate"`. No `tailwind.config.js`, no raw hex, use `--color-*` tokens from `theme.css`.
  Merge classes with `cx` from `utils/cx.ts`.
- React Aria semantics: use `Button`, `TextField`, `ComboBox`, `Select`, `Dialog`, `Table` primitives; every icon-only
  button has `aria-label`; focus rings visible; Esc closes; Enter submits.
- Layout: icon rail (modules) → module sidebar (sections from `config/navigation.ts`) → page with breadcrumb, title,
  primary action. Compact density: 36px table rows, 32px inputs. Numeric cells right-aligned, `tabular-nums`.
- Status badges use the ERPNext status label and a fixed colour map in `components/erp/status-colors.ts`
  (Draft gray, Submitted/Open blue, To Bill/To Deliver orange, Completed/Paid green, Cancelled red, Overdue red, Closed gray).
- Every list/form/report has empty, loading (skeleton), and error states. Destructive actions confirm with consequences.
- Recharts: `'use client'`, `responsive` prop on the chart root, shared `<ChartTooltip/>`, colours via CSS vars
  (`var(--color-utility-brand-600)` …), horizontal grid only, compact number format. Keep chart components dumb; data comes from RSC.
- Forms: React Hook Form + `zodResolver(doctypeSchema)`; field components receive `field` + descriptor; read-only after
  submit except `allowOnSubmit` fields; child-table rows editable inline with keyboard navigation.
- Dark mode via tokens; test both.
